            {
              "content": "=Analyze the following phone call transcript and return ONLY valid JSON.\n\nExtract the caller's information carefully.\n\nRules:\n- If the caller states their name, extract it exactly.\n- Only use \"Unknown\" if no caller name is present in the transcript.\n- If an appointment is requested, extract the appointment date and time.\n- appointmentDate must use YYYY-MM-DD format.\n- appointmentTime must use HH:mm 24-hour format.\n\nReturn exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"callerName\": \"string\",\n  \"intent\": \"string\",\n  \"summary\": \"string\",\n  \"appointmentRequested\": true,\n  \"appointmentDate\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\",\n  \"appointmentTime\": \"HH:mm\",\n  \"actionRequired\": \"string\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"string\",\n  \"urgency\": \"string\"\n}\n\nTranscript:\n{{ $json.transcript }}"
